                                    "patching_rect": [ 560.0, 240.0, 182.0, 122.0 ],
                                    "text": "Enabling or disabling the Filter parameter in the Options~ subpatcher either selects the global or the band-limited boost. Additionally a softclipping distortion may be engaged, depending on wether \"clean\" or \"dirty\" boost is wanted."
                                }
                            },
                            {
